<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85430" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ̆τῑμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμή</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>much-revered,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					109.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>highly priced,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μουσοεργός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Nat.Puer.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			; <i>very costly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				5.35.5
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Rufin.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				57.9
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					14.2.3
				</span></i>
			 (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τελῶς</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
